{"ID":"20240205153821-cscngyh","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240205153821-cscngyh","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153821-cscngyh\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206093655-0y99tj5\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240611144145-bklmbi4\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:3120,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240611144729-ft0oafa\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:8,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:8\u0026#125;","title":"171知母","type":"doc","updated":"20240814155604"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206093655-0y99tj5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206093655-0y99tj5","updated":"20240206093703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产山西、河南、甘肃、陕西、内蒙古等地。\n【性状】\t该品呈长条状，微弯曲，略扁，偶有分枝，长315cm，直径0.81.5cm，一端有浅黄色的茎叶残痕。表面黄棕色至棕色，上面有一凹沟，具紧密排列的环状节，节上密生黄棕色的残存叶基，由两侧向根茎上方生长；下面隆起而略皱缩，并有凹陷或突起的点状根痕。质硬，易折断，断面黄白色。气微，味微甜、略苦，嚼之带粘性。\n【性味】\t苦、甘，寒。\n【功效】\t清热泻火，生津润燥。用治外感热病，高热烦渴，内治肺热咳嗽，胃热消渴，肺燥咳嗽；肠燥便秘；骨蒸潮热。\n【注解】\t“金包头”：即指毛知母。指未去外皮的知母，顶端有残留的浅黄色叶痕及茎基。"}]},{"ID":"20240206093656-02xeonw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206093656-02xeonw","updated":"20240206093656"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206093656-vze81yp.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205160327-0lcyeiy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205160327-0lcyeiy","updated":"20240205160327"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"知母"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/知母-20240205160327-7c22ncr.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240814144246-8w6b7qq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240814144246-8w6b7qq","updated":"20240814152658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 355px;","style":"width: 345px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"知母"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/知母-20240814144246-7w2p8m3.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 345px;\" parent-style=\"width: 355px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 434px;","style":"width: 424px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"知母 (21)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/知母 21-20240814152647-krtgwr8.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 424px;\" parent-style=\"width: 434px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 369px;","style":"width: 359px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"知母 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/知母 2-20240814144452-ir1fv9j.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 359px;\" parent-style=\"width: 369px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240814150743-a3jt7v9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240814150743-a3jt7v9","updated":"20240814150843"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 586px;","style":"width: 576px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"No